          "@value": "Describes normal measurement, actuation, sampling properties such as accuracy, range, precision etc… of a system under some specified conditions such as a temperature range. The capabilities specified here are those that affect the promary purpose of the system, while those in operatingrange represent the system's normal operating environment, including conditions that don't affect the observation or the actuations."
